# Backend patterns

- Feature modules under `backend/src/<name>/` with controller + service + DTOs.
- Use `@Public()` only for register/login; `@Roles(Role.ADMIN)` for manage routes.
- Return handler data directly; wrapping is done by `@backend/src/common/interceptors/api-response.interceptor.ts`.
- Credit changes: only through `applyLedger` in the same transaction as balance updates.
- Attempt lifecycle: stake at start, settle at submit with row lock + status check—see `@backend/src/attempts/attempts.service.ts`.
- Schema changes: edit `prisma/schema.prisma`, migrate, update seed if needed, extend e2e in `@backend/test/app.e2e-spec.ts`.
